  "body": "This PR resolves DEBT-028 by adding per-instance async reference-counted locking in WorkflowRuntime for execute() and resume() calls targeting the same instance_id. Includes comprehensive unit and concurrency test coverage.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [3172688588772460252](https://jules.google.com/task/3172688588772460252) started by @1h0lde4*",
